{"words": [{"text": "فَإِنْ", "translation": "Then if"}, {"text": "حَآجُّوكَ", "translation": "they argue with you"}, {"text": "فَقُلْ", "translation": "then say"}, {"text": "أَسْلَمْتُ", "translation": "I have submitted"}, {"text": "وَجْهِىَ", "translation": "myself"}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ", "translation": "to Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَنِ", "translation": "and (those) who"}, {"text": "ٱتَّبَعَنِ ۗ", "translation": "follow me"}, {"text": "وَقُل", "translation": "And say"}, {"text": "لِّلَّذِينَ", "translation": "to those who"}, {"text": "أُوتُوا۟", "translation": "were given"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأُمِّيِّـۧنَ", "translation": "and the unlettered people"}, {"text": "ءَأَسْلَمْتُمْ ۚ", "translation": "Have you submitted yourselves"}, {"text": "فَإِنْ", "translation": "Then if"}, {"text": "أَسْلَمُوا۟", "translation": "they submit"}, {"text": "فَقَدِ", "translation": "then surely"}, {"text": "ٱهْتَدَوا۟ ۖ", "translation": "they are guided"}, {"text": "وَّإِن", "translation": "But if"}, {"text": "تَوَلَّوْا۟", "translation": "they turn back"}, {"text": "فَإِنَّمَا", "translation": "then only"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكَ", "translation": "on you"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ ۗ", "translation": "(is) to [the] convey"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "بَصِيرٌۢ", "translation": "(is) All-Seer"}, {"text": "بِٱلْعِبَادِ", "translation": "of [His] slaves"}], "sahih": "So if they argue with you, say, \"I have submitted myself to Allāh [in Islām], and [so have] those who follow me.\" And say to those who were given the Scripture and [to] the unlearned,1 \"Have you submitted yourselves?\" And if they submit [in Islām], they are rightly guided; but if they turn away - then upon you is only the [duty of] notification. And Allāh is Seeing of [His] servants."}